"shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"gnXN6LuSC3IoMCOtRl8sQw","review_id":"2kv3GeCIV8bH4k579vBY1w","date":"2012-01-06T12:59:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9557123184204102,"text_excerpt":"I had a breakfast sandwich here yesterday and it was really good. I like a good deli and needed a quick bite. They have omelets as well named for various famous baseball players from NY. The bagel was excellent and the sandwich reminded me of the dozens I have eaten in NY. They carry Boars Head and it looks like everything they are using is of excellent quality. It's a little quiet in there but I like the decor and the 2 guys were not unfriendly. I would go back and give it another try."},{"business_id":"gnXN6LuSC3IoMCOtRl8sQw","review_id":"zVi4WhKP4SkExlcdaFOhcg","date":"2020-05-22T14:22:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.936369776725769,"text_excerpt":"I have like three fave deli's in New Orleans and this is one of them. A local who supports the community and has reopened phase one for take out and delivery. An Established restaurant that has a great variety of sandwiches, and beyond. My fave being their take on the Reuben. The Brooklyn Dodger is my fave, a hearty sandwich with beautiful bread, and built big enough for two. however, I always have to get more when the family comes so my other go to is the great bambino, another take on that reuben. LOL give me some onion rings, some corn and shrimp chowder and a beer, and I'm good for the day. I am so thankful this place is still serving the community. Nothing else compares to a real New..."},{"business_id":"gnXN6LuSC3IoMCOtRl8sQw","review_id":"UDEWm3iNYI222Alajb0bxg","date":"2015-08-27T15:34:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9241808652877808,"text_excerpt":"Empire Deli is a hidden gem of delicious in downtown New Orleans, and a sanctuary on the parade route during Carnival. Its at a super accessible location on St. Charles Ave across from the Intercontinental Hotel in the One Shell Square building and has an extensive menu that covers breakfast and lunch, including hearty, homemade daily lunch specials like pasta and meatloaf for around $10. Service is fast, friendly, and they strive to make your order perfect. Even though the restaurant bleeds New York; the hospitality is Southern all the way. You can always catch the Yankees game on the TVs or hear it on the sound system when they're not playing awesome music from the kitchen .. Which give..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gnXN6LuSC3IoMCOtRl8sQw","photo_id":"Z2oUrruOO4fZevFRPKHOnw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Z2oUrruOO4fZevFRPKHOnw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8755007982254028},{"business_id":"gnXN6LuSC3IoMCOtRl8sQw","photo_id":"c6l7Ax9AefBPDceHxbMhkA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/c6l7Ax9AefBPDceHxbMhkA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8074760437011719},{"business_id":"gnXN6LuSC3IoMCOtRl8sQw","photo_id":"JptwJO1A3AW-rD8Aia5YhQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/JptwJO1A3AW-rD8Aia5YhQ.jpg","visual_representativene